# Resume

Senior software engineer with {{experience 2019-09}} of professional experience building web applications. I started with PHP and Laravel, moved into JavaScript and React, and now work mostly in TypeScript, NestJS, Next.js, and Ruby on Rails. I'm a Senior Software Engineer at Prayers Connect and a part-time Founding Engineer at MeetPure Events. I'm learning Rust.

Experience is counted from my first paid role (Freewire BD, September 2019). There are no gaps between roles up to today.

